Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01RYe92n7spgy8vtm4CovRWA
---
 crates/horizon-mod-sdk/examples/crafting-probe/src/lib.rs    | 5 ++++-
 .../horizon-mod-sdk/examples/crafting-probe/tests/craft.toml | 4 ++--
 crates/horizon-mod-sdk/wit/horizon.wit                       | 4 ++++
 crates/horizon-mods/src/api_level.rs                         | 5 +++--
 crates/horizon-mods/src/runtime.rs                           | 5 +++++
