+    // level 9 is `recipe-types`, 10 is `net`, 11 is `entities`, 12 is `player-items`, 13 is `chunks`, 14 is `world.set-block-property`, 15 is `recipe-types.cooking-recipes`, 16 is `player-control.get-look`, 17 is `world.set-item-faces` and `set-item-eject`, 18 is `world.set-tank-filter`, 22 is `world.pull-items`, 23 is `world.mine-block`, 24 is `world.set-capabilities-enabled`, 25 is `player-items.compare-and-set-slot`, `player-control.set-motion` and `set-allow-flight`, 26 is `world.spawn-particles`, 27 is `recipe-types.burn-time`, 28 is `recipe-types.crafting-find`, `crafting-matches` and `item-max-stack-size`, 29 is `player-control.get-state` and `set-food`, 30 is `recipe-types.item-tags`, 31 is `players.tell-overlay` and the body functions of `player-control`, 32 is `world.pack-block` and `unpack-block`, 33 is `entities.set-entity-fire`, 34 is `world.set-menu-text`, 35 is `world.block-hardness`, 36 is `entities.spawn-mod-entity`, 37 is `entities.items-in-box` and `take-dropped-item`, 38 is `world.set-comparator-output`, 39 is `world.break-blocks`, 40 is `recipe-types.item-tag-members`.
